# The wheel this repository builds is vendored, hash-recorded, and verified by
# five consumer projects. A working copy whose line endings differ from a fresh
# checkout produces a different wheel while `git status` still reports clean,
# which makes "build commit X" non-deterministic and every consumer look
# drifted for no reason. Pin source to LF so the artifact is stable.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.whl binary
*.png binary
*.mp4 binary
